  "details": "https://hello.vrchat.com/vrchat-plus-faq\n\nIn the \"What do I get for signing up with VRC+?\" section, there's some text about \"Currently, you get a few things for signing up for VRC+:\", but it doesn't mention custom stickers benefit for VRC+ subscribers. Please add this benefit to the FAQ's list of VRC+ benefits.\n\nOddly enough, (custom) stickers are listed as a benefit on the main VRC+ advert page at https://hello.vrchat.com/vrchatplus but it's missing from the FAQ.\n\nRelated: https://feedback.vrchat.com/website/p/update-vrc-feature-page",
